        },
        {
          "text": "Awo bwe baali bakuba Suteefano amayinja, n'akoowoola Katonda ng'agamba nti, \"Mukama wange Yesu, twala omwoyo gwange.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.59",
